{"author": "olgasi", "category": "linkedin", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["linkedin-posts-2026-08-20-whom-do-you-think-you-md-b3ffd89a57:u000002"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "If it sounds like \"hi, I've been in Dubai for four years, here's me flying business class, here's me closing multiple deals\" - that is exactly what creates the \"who do you think you are\" feeling in your reader.", "unit_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-08-20-whom-do-you-think-you-md-b3ffd89a57:u000002"}], "text": "Publishing content that focuses on self-promotion can lead to readers feeling a \"who do you think you are\" reaction, as nothing is offered to them besides claims about the author's achievements."}, "title": "Content vs. Self-promotion", "topic": "content_self-promotion"}, "content_hash": "3c3cc0b04a62a2fa1a85e2936382d6b5366d63e45200eee6bc3e54d6339fc7b6", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "linkedin-posts-2026-08-20-whom-do-you-think-you-md-b3ffd89a57:knowledge:41f71c8be03326c3", "metadata_hash": "16c0c60ca948cd93417bcd518667875051210afda43ef7544962302b1c03a381", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-08-20T05:29:35.614000Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "post", "source_hash": "65c812bd3c3be3caaccb4e7c0f435f2eccc5583c23763201b7a1b0045619afcb", "source_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-08-20-whom-do-you-think-you-md-b3ffd89a57", "source_url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/olgasi_whom-do-you-think-you-are-and-why-should-activity-7496075944873459713-Q1ec", "title": "Content vs. Self-promotion", "topic": "content_self-promotion", "topic_slug": "content_self-promotion"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "linkedin", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["linkedin-posts-2026-08-20-whom-do-you-think-you-md-b3ffd89a57:u000002"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "advice", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "Idea promotion! It creates value the only thing that people would actually like and share.", "unit_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-08-20-whom-do-you-think-you-md-b3ffd89a57:u000002"}], "text": "Promoting ideas instead of oneself can create value, which is more likely to be liked and shared by others."}, "title": "Idea Promotion", "topic": "content_self-promotion"}, "content_hash": "3c3cc0b04a62a2fa1a85e2936382d6b5366d63e45200eee6bc3e54d6339fc7b6", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "linkedin-posts-2026-08-20-whom-do-you-think-you-md-b3ffd89a57:knowledge:b4258c9497311805", "metadata_hash": "16c0c60ca948cd93417bcd518667875051210afda43ef7544962302b1c03a381", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-08-20T05:29:35.614000Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "post", "source_hash": "65c812bd3c3be3caaccb4e7c0f435f2eccc5583c23763201b7a1b0045619afcb", "source_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-08-20-whom-do-you-think-you-md-b3ffd89a57", "source_url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/olgasi_whom-do-you-think-you-are-and-why-should-activity-7496075944873459713-Q1ec", "title": "Idea Promotion", "topic": "content_self-promotion", "topic_slug": "content_self-promotion"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "linkedin", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["linkedin-posts-2026-08-20-whom-do-you-think-you-md-b3ffd89a57:u000001"], "cue": null, "diagnosis": null, "kind": "illustration", "outcome": null, "rationale": null, "response": null, "situation": {"citations": [{"quote": "You're posting. Videos, stories, articles. You show up, you say something, you are consistent… And then nothing.", "unit_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-08-20-whom-do-you-think-you-md-b3ffd89a57:u000001"}], "text": "The author reflects on the experience of posting consistently on LinkedIn without receiving engagement in the form of likes, comments, DMs, or leads."}, "speaker_id": null, "strategy": null, "title": "LinkedIn Posting Reflection", "topic": "content_self-promotion"}, "content_hash": "3c3cc0b04a62a2fa1a85e2936382d6b5366d63e45200eee6bc3e54d6339fc7b6", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "linkedin-posts-2026-08-20-whom-do-you-think-you-md-b3ffd89a57:cases:c896337fd77d1500", "metadata_hash": "16c0c60ca948cd93417bcd518667875051210afda43ef7544962302b1c03a381", "product": "cases", "published_at": "2026-08-20T05:29:35.614000Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "post", "source_hash": "65c812bd3c3be3caaccb4e7c0f435f2eccc5583c23763201b7a1b0045619afcb", "source_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-08-20-whom-do-you-think-you-md-b3ffd89a57", "source_url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/olgasi_whom-do-you-think-you-are-and-why-should-activity-7496075944873459713-Q1ec", "title": "LinkedIn Posting Reflection", "topic": "content_self-promotion", "topic_slug": "content_self-promotion"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "linkedin", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["linkedin-posts-2026-08-20-whom-do-you-think-you-md-b3ffd89a57:u000002"], "form": "structure", "observation": {"citations": [{"quote": "If it sounds like \"hi, I've been in Dubai for four years, here's me flying business class, here's me closing multiple deals\" - that is exactly what creates the \"who do you think you are\" feeling in your reader.", "unit_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-08-20-whom-do-you-think-you-md-b3ffd89a57:u000002"}], "text": "The text contrasts self-promotion with idea promotion by giving examples of self-promotional content and explaining why it may not engage an audience."}, "purpose": null, "speaker_id": null, "title": "Self-promotion vs. Idea Promotion", "topic": "content_self-promotion"}, "content_hash": "3c3cc0b04a62a2fa1a85e2936382d6b5366d63e45200eee6bc3e54d6339fc7b6", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "linkedin-posts-2026-08-20-whom-do-you-think-you-md-b3ffd89a57:expression:e986a5cc5c9753f5", "metadata_hash": "16c0c60ca948cd93417bcd518667875051210afda43ef7544962302b1c03a381", "product": "expression", "published_at": "2026-08-20T05:29:35.614000Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "post", "source_hash": "65c812bd3c3be3caaccb4e7c0f435f2eccc5583c23763201b7a1b0045619afcb", "source_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-08-20-whom-do-you-think-you-md-b3ffd89a57", "source_url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/olgasi_whom-do-you-think-you-are-and-why-should-activity-7496075944873459713-Q1ec", "title": "Self-promotion vs. Idea Promotion", "topic": "content_self-promotion", "topic_slug": "content_self-promotion"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "linkedin", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["linkedin-posts-2026-08-20-whom-do-you-think-you-md-b3ffd89a57:u000003"], "form": "rhetorical_move", "observation": {"citations": [{"quote": "Comment below if you feel? Or I’m the only one who feels that way?", "unit_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-08-20-whom-do-you-think-you-md-b3ffd89a57:u000003"}], "text": "The author uses a question to engage the audience by asking if they share the same feelings and inviting comments."}, "purpose": null, "speaker_id": null, "title": "Engagement Query", "topic": "content_self-promotion"}, "content_hash": "3c3cc0b04a62a2fa1a85e2936382d6b5366d63e45200eee6bc3e54d6339fc7b6", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "linkedin-posts-2026-08-20-whom-do-you-think-you-md-b3ffd89a57:expression:e88816344bbb2eb1", "metadata_hash": "16c0c60ca948cd93417bcd518667875051210afda43ef7544962302b1c03a381", "product": "expression", "published_at": "2026-08-20T05:29:35.614000Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "post", "source_hash": "65c812bd3c3be3caaccb4e7c0f435f2eccc5583c23763201b7a1b0045619afcb", "source_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-08-20-whom-do-you-think-you-md-b3ffd89a57", "source_url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/olgasi_whom-do-you-think-you-are-and-why-should-activity-7496075944873459713-Q1ec", "title": "Engagement Query", "topic": "content_self-promotion", "topic_slug": "content_self-promotion"}
